text: >-
  Q Menus

  Arial

  May 27th: SU-BTU flies into Provo. Walid Mahmoud is aboard.

  May 31st: Charlie spoke at the "Biggs for Governor Rally" in Phoenix, AZ

  June 2025: Sean Feucht is credibly accused as having been involved in fraud
  and

  embezzlement. Formal statement issued by multiple organizations.

  June 2nd: Egyptian "Walid" departs Provo.

  June 13th: Iran and Israel's 12 day war commences

  June 22nd: Operation Midnight Hammer, American bombs Iran

  June 24th: Israel and Iran's War comes to an end.

  June 25th: Governor Bill Lee takes a trip to France for a Howmet "Aerospace"
  Engineering

  investment in Tennessee. This is only the 4th time since assuming office that
  he has made an

  international trip. This will lead to an investment in Tennessee from France.

  July 7th-July 9th: Bibi Netanyahu visits America.

  July 2nd: Rob McCoy formally resigns as the lead pastor of Calvary Church in
  Thousand Oaks

  (pre-planned retirement reported in January).

  / Editing

